-- url     : https://prove2.me/theorems/f92a0f35-8fbe-43d7-bb47-a36dfec0c4eb
-- title:
--   A concrete integer RAM program for the canonical separator tape
-- statement:
--   An integer RAM program constructs window bitmaps and menus, walks the bounded-depth cut tree, enumerates boundary assignments, computes child key names and writes each candidate record. Register 3 supplies the slot number. The integer-only instruction language lowers to the mission machine. The definition specifies a particular program for verification of its execution and runtime.
-- source:
--   Ravichandran and Reyzin, Exact Sum-of-Radii Clustering under Any Constant Stability, Appendix A.6, https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.03547

import Definitions.Def_StableMSR_CanonicalRegionalCompiler
